@startuml
title Healthcare Portal State Machine

[*] --> Registration

state Registration
Registration : entry / Start New User
Registration : do / Enter Details
Registration : exit / Registered or Failed

state RegDecision <<choice>>
Registration --> RegDecision

state ValidRegistration
ValidRegistration : entry / Successfully Registered
ValidRegistration : do / Proceed to Login
ValidRegistration : exit / Move to Login State

state InvalidRegistration
InvalidRegistration : entry / Registration Failed
InvalidRegistration : do / Access Denied
InvalidRegistration : exit / End Session

RegDecision --> ValidRegistration
RegDecision --> InvalidRegistration

ValidRegistration --> Login

state Login
Login : entry / Enter Credentials
Login : do / Verify User
Login : exit / Successfully Logged In or Not

state LoginDecision <<choice>>
Login --> LoginDecision

state ValidLogin
ValidLogin : entry / Successfully Logged In
ValidLogin : do / Access Granted
ValidLogin : exit / Proceed to Dashboard

state InvalidLogin
InvalidLogin : entry / Wrong Credentials
InvalidLogin : do / Display Error
InvalidLogin : exit / Return to Login or End Session

LoginDecision --> ValidLogin
LoginDecision --> InvalidLogin

ValidLogin --> Dashboard

state Dashboard
Dashboard : entry / Welcome Screen
Dashboard : do / Access Features
Dashboard : exit / Continue Using or Logout

state DashboardAction <<choice>>
Dashboard --> DashboardAction

state ViewContent
ViewContent : entry / Read News/Expert Content
ViewContent : do / Access Information
ViewContent : exit / Return to Dashboard

state HealthInfo
HealthInfo : entry / Check Symptoms/Health Info
HealthInfo : do / Analyze Data
HealthInfo : exit / Show Results or Continue

DashboardAction --> ViewContent
DashboardAction --> HealthInfo

HealthInfo --> ResultsReview

state ResultsReview
ResultsReview : entry / Review Results
ResultsReview : do / Decide Next Steps
ResultsReview : exit / Return to Dashboard or Logout

ViewContent --> ResultsReview

ResultsReview --> PaymentChoice

state PaymentChoice <<choice>>
PaymentChoice : entry / Choose Payment Method
PaymentChoice : do / Select Option
PaymentChoice : exit / Proceed with Selected Method

state CashPayment
CashPayment : entry / Choose Cash
CashPayment : do / Provide Details and Confirm
CashPayment : exit / Processed or Cancelled

state InsurancePayment
InsurancePayment : entry / Use Insurance
InsurancePayment
@enduml
